<title>USA: Report asks $300,000 ethics penalty for Gingrich.</title>
<headline>Report asks $300,000 ethics penalty for Gingrich.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A special counsel recommended on Friday that House Speaker Newt Gingrich pay a $300,000 penalty as part of the proposed punishment for admitted ethics violations.</p>
</text>
